@startuml kairos-giving-dashboard-sequence
title View Giving Dashboard (Admin)

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Giving Dashboard
WebAdmin -> API: GET /finance/dashboard?branchId=...
API -> DB: Aggregate payments by type, branch,\npledges, fulfilment
DB --> API: Aggregated data
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {givingSummary}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render totals, charts, pledge progress

@enduml
